y in a properly configured build environment.\n\nThe patch file is saved at: `CustomStudyDialog-toast.patch`"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":60700,"output_tokens":419,"cache_read_input_tokens":58688,"total_tokens":61119}}}
